# Layouts and workspaces (ED-2), in a fresh project made from the Empty template (RunChecks
# "Editor layouts"): its shipped imgui.cfg is the default layout. A named workspace opens its
# subject's panels until it's arranged; switching with panels open and Reset Layout both rebuild
# the dock tree; Reset puts the active workspace back to the shipped layout and its own panels.
wait 20
assert-window Profiler | false
# Debug (workspace 5): the profiler and resource monitor.
action Workspace.Select5
wait 5
assert-window Profiler | true
assert-window Resource Monitor | true
screenshot .tmp/LayoutFlows_debug.png
# Shader (workspace 3), switched to with those panels open: the shader graph editor.
action Workspace.Select3
wait 5
assert-window Shader Graph | true
# A panel opened by hand goes with Reset Layout; the workspace's own panel comes back.
show-window Localization
wait 3
assert-window Localization | true
action View.ResetLayout
wait-log Layout: reset workspace 3 (Shader) | 120
wait 5
assert-window Localization | false
assert-window Shader Graph | true
screenshot .tmp/LayoutFlows_shader.png
quit
